<title>UK: Merrill sets warrants on Nestle AG.</title>
<headline>Merrill sets warrants on Nestle AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets said</p>
<p>it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on Nestle</p>
<p>AG registered shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1950 CHF		  PREMIUM	12.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.15 CHF (INDICATIVE) GEARING	16.10 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 30.MAY.97-20.NOV.98   PAYDATE	27.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1840 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
